{"name":"Ewa","hex":"#454042","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Ewa (woreda)","blocks":[{"text":"Ewa is one of the Districts of Ethiopia, or woredas in the Afar Region of Ethiopia. Part of the Administrative Zone 4, Ewa is located near the base of the eastern escarpment of the\nEthiopian Highlands, and bordered on the south by the Administrative Zone 1, on the west by the Amhara Region, on the north by Gulina, and on the east by Aura; part of its boundary with Zone 1 is defined by the Logiya River. The major settlement in Ewa is Alele Subula."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ewa_(woreda)"},{"title":"Ewa, Nauru","blocks":[{"text":"Ewa is a district in the Pacific nation of the Republic of Nauru, located in the north of island."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Ewa_Beach.jpg/330px-Ewa_Beach.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ewa%2C_Nauru"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Christ_the_King_Catholic_Church_%2815219795409%29.jpg/500px-Christ_the_King_Catholic_Church_%2815219795409%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Christ_the_King_Catholic_Church_%2815219795409%29.jpg/1280px-Christ_the_King_Catholic_Church_%2815219795409%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/Christ_the_King_Catholic_Church_%2815219795409%29.jpg/500px-Christ_the_King_Catholic_Church_%2815219795409%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChrist_the_King_Catholic_Church_(15219795409).jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}